# Gaudi map

Before cross-file orientation, Read `.cursor/gaudi/MAP.md`.

- The map is ranked signatures, not ownership or behavior.
- Grep and Read every file you will change. Do not edit from the map alone.
- If the map is missing or `gaudi status` is stale, run `gaudi generate` first.
- Never hand-edit `MAP.md`. Never `@`-include it from this or any rule.
- Cloud Agent does not run sessionStart; generate if the file is missing.

Do not treat path rank as people or ownership.
